  "content": "<p>Capstone Copper Corp. is a Canadian-based base metals mining company focused on copper production and development in the Americas. Headquartered in Vancouver, British Columbia, the company operates the Pinto Valley copper mine in Arizona, the Mantos Blancos copper-silver mine in Chile, and the Mantoverde copper-gold mine in Chile. Capstone Copper is committed to sustainable mining practices and is positioned for significant growth through its portfolio of high-quality assets and development projects, aiming to become a leading intermediate copper producer to support global electrification.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20MacKenzie\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John MacKenzie</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. MacKenzie has over 30 years of experience in the metals and mining industry. Prior to the business combination of Capstone Mining and Mantos Copper, he was the Executive Chairman of Mantos Copper. He previously served as CEO of Copper for Anglo American.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Raman%20Randhawa\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Raman Randhawa</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President and Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Randhawa is a Chartered Professional Accountant with over 20 years of financial experience in the mining industry. He previously served as CFO of Capstone Mining and held senior roles at Goldcorp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Cashel%20Meagher\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Cashel Meagher</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Meagher has over 25 years of experience in the mining industry. He previously served as Senior Vice President and Chief Operating Officer of Hudbay Minerals Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Wendy%20King\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Wendy King</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, Risk, ESG and General Counsel</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. King has over 25 years of experience in legal and corporate secretary roles. She previously served as Senior Vice President, General Counsel and Corporate Secretary of Central GoldTrust and Silver Wheaton Corp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jerrold%20Henniet\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jerrold Henniet</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President, People</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Henniet has over 20 years of experience in human resources. He previously held senior HR roles at New Gold Inc. and Goldcorp.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alison%20Baker\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alison Baker</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Baker has over 25 years of experience in the provision of audit, capital markets and advisory services. She was previously a partner at PwC and EY.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Anne%20Giardini\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Anne Giardini</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Giardini is a lawyer and executive with over 30 years of experience in the resource sector. She was previously President of Weyerhaeuser Company Limited and serves on several boards.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Anne%20Labelle\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Anne Labelle</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Labelle is a geologist and lawyer with over 25 years of experience in the mining industry, specializing in exploration, environmental and legal matters.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bob%20Gallagher\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bob Gallagher</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Gallagher has over 40 years of experience in the mining industry. He was previously the President and CEO of New Gold Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Brack\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Brack</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Lead Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Brack has over 30 years of experience in the mining investment banking and corporate development sectors. He was previously the Managing Director and Industry Head, Mining at BMO Nesbitt Burns.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Ireland\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Ireland</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Ireland has over 40 years of experience in the mining and financial sectors. He is the founder, CEO and CIO of Geologic Resource Partners LLC.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gillian%20McCombie\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gillian McCombie</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Human Resources</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. McCombie has over 25 years of experience in human resources and corporate operations, previously holding senior roles at various mining companies.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gillian%20Winckler\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gillian Winckler</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Winckler is a former mining executive and investment banker with over 25 years of experience in the metals and mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kalidas%20Madhavpeddi\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kalidas Madhavpeddi</a></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Kalidas Madhavpeddi was appointed Chairman in July 2021. He has over 40 years of experience in the international mining industry, including as CEO of China Molybdenum International. He holds degrees from the Indian Institute of Technology and the University of Iowa.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peter%20Meredith\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peter Meredith</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director / Lead Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Meredith has over 40 years of experience in the mining industry and was previously the CFO of Ivanhoe Mines Ltd.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Ireland\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Ireland</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chair and Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Ireland has over 40 years of experience in the mining and financial sectors. He is the founder, CEO and CIO of Geologic Resource Partners LLC.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20MacKenzie\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John MacKenzie</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">CEO of Capstone Copper Corp. with extensive experience in global copper mining operations.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alison%20Baker\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alison Baker</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Baker has over 25 years of experience in the provision of audit, capital markets and advisory services. She was previously a partner at PwC and EY.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bob%20Gallagher\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bob Gallagher</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Gallagher has over 40 years of experience in the mining industry. He was previously the President and CEO of New Gold Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Anne%20Labelle\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Anne Labelle</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Labelle is a geologist and lawyer with over 25 years of experience in the mining industry, specializing in exploration, environmental and legal matters.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peter%20Meredith\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peter Meredith</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Meredith has over 40 years of experience in the mining industry and was previously the CFO of Ivanhoe Mines Ltd.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gillian%20Winckler\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gillian Winckler</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Winckler is a former mining executive and investment banker with over 25 years of experience in the metals and mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Anne%20Giardini\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Anne Giardini</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Giardini is a lawyer and executive with over 30 years of experience in the resource sector. She was previously President of Weyerhaeuser Company Limited and serves on several boards.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Brack\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Brack</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Lead Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Brack has over 30 years of experience in the mining investment banking and corporate development sectors. He was previously the Managing Director and Industry Head, Mining at BMO Nesbitt Burns.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kalidas%20Madhavpeddi\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kalidas Madhavpeddi</a></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Kalidas Madhavpeddi was appointed Chairman in July 2021. He has over 40 years of experience in the international mining industry, including as CEO of China Molybdenum International. He holds degrees from the Indian Institute of Technology and the University of Iowa.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://capstonecopper.com/about-us/leadership-and-governance/management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Capstone Copper Official Website - Management Team</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://capstonecopper.com/about-us/leadership-and-governance/board-of-directors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Capstone Copper Official Website - Board of Directors</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sedarplus.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Management Information Circular dated March 27, 2024</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-27)</span></li></ul>"
